00:02:16.534 --> 00:02:21.194
On October 31, a travel trailer turned up overnight in a cornfield off a quiet road

00:02:21.194 --> 00:02:25.074
in Abbotsford, and neighbors told the Vancouver Sun someone had backed it in

00:02:25.074 --> 00:02:30.454
neatly and left. Old RVs are landing in fields, forests, rest areas and parks

00:02:30.454 --> 00:02:35.174
because getting rid of one here is hard and expensive. Phil Piers, who owns Big

00:02:35.174 --> 00:02:38.854
Phil's rubbish removal, says people think there is scrap value and there is

00:02:38.854 --> 00:02:43.094
not. The frame is the only metal, so the unit has to come apart. Siding,

00:02:43.374 --> 00:02:47.714
insulation, fiberglass pulled off wood and a poultry, gray and black tank

00:02:47.714 --> 00:02:53.374
strained. Landfills take some of it, recyclers take the rest, and septic tanks plus old fridges

00:02:53.374 --> 00:02:59.134
that might hold ammonia need careful handling. A small camper, including a truck, camper, typically

00:02:59.134 --> 00:03:05.174
costs about $1,000 to dispose of. A large trailer can run several thousand. If he can fix one and

00:03:05.174 --> 00:03:10.834
find a buyer, he charges for the tow, takes legal ownership, and sells it on. Some owners pay about

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:17.174
$200 instead. He says if that price looks too good, it usually is. A woman in a Maple Ridge Facebook

00:03:17.174 --> 00:03:21.274
group offered several hundred dollars to have an old boat hauled. She never called back

00:03:21.274 --> 00:03:25.674
after his quote, and a neighbor later saw that boat dumped beside the highway in derroche.

00:03:26.114 --> 00:03:29.094
Police looked into it. Pires does not think she was charged.

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:33.554
Abbotsford police sergeant Paul Walker says dumping is not usually a police file,

00:03:33.814 --> 00:03:39.314
unless the vehicle is stolen, tied to a crime, or a safety risk. A VIN is hard to trace when

00:03:39.314 --> 00:03:44.514
the registration was never updated. He says most of these units are uninsured, often for years,

00:03:44.514 --> 00:03:46.654
and proving who left them as the hard part.

00:03:47.174 --> 00:03:50.054
Abbott's Ferd has a lot of RVs and several big dealerships.

00:03:50.394 --> 00:03:54.454
